{"product_id":"fraction-studio-collection","title":"Fraction Complete","description":"\u003cp data-end=\"388\" data-start=\"239\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Fraction Complete Bundle\u003c\/strong\u003e contains all current paid expansions and the engine itself at a more affordable price point.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAfter more than a year in development, this is our first-ever VST and it changes the way a plugin feels inside your DAW. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFraction is a sample based engine built from Pure Hardware but with Unmatched Controls unlike anything ever before.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"620\" data-start=\"390\"\u003eSynths, instruments, and pedals worth more than \u003cstrong data-end=\"527\" data-start=\"519\"\u003e$80k \u003c\/strong\u003ethat we used to make Fraction happen. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"872\" data-start=\"622\"\u003eBut Fraction is more than Hardware Sound. It’s about unmatched \u003cstrong data-end=\"677\" data-start=\"666\"\u003econtrol\u003c\/strong\u003e. With features like the \u003cstrong data-end=\"722\" data-start=\"702\"\u003eAlgorythm XY Pad\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-end=\"738\" data-start=\"724\"\u003eFractalize\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-end=\"751\" data-start=\"740\"\u003eVintage\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-end=\"762\" data-start=\"753\"\u003eColor\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong data-end=\"774\" data-start=\"764\"\u003eSmooth\u003c\/strong\u003e, and \u003cstrong data-end=\"792\" data-start=\"780\"\u003eHumanize\u003c\/strong\u003e, every preset becomes a playground you can bend, twist, and shape in seconds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"980\" data-start=\"874\"\u003eThis video walks you through Fraction, what makes it different, and why it’s more than just another VST.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"997\" data-start=\"982\"\u003e🔥 Full Bundle includes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1263\" data-start=\"998\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1034\" data-start=\"998\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1034\" data-start=\"1000\"\u003e580+ presets \/ 350+ sound sources\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1034\" data-start=\"998\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1034\" data-start=\"1000\"\u003eMulti-velocity sampling (up to 500 wavs per preset)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1152\" data-start=\"1091\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1152\" data-start=\"1093\"\u003ePure Hardware Sound: Prophet, Juno, Moog, Arturia, Polybrute \u0026amp; more\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1199\" data-start=\"1153\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1199\" data-start=\"1155\"\u003eCustom controls never seen before in a VST such as The Algorythm, Color, Vintage, Fractalize and more\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1263\" data-start=\"1200\"\u003e\n\u003cp style=\"text-align: left;\" data-end=\"1263\" data-start=\"1202\"\u003eLifetime free updates — new presets and expansions included\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eForming a new Era of Musical Software. \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFraction is now available at eraformaudio.com .\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Eraform, Prototype","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":53110513172747,"sku":null,"price":139.95,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0928\/1860\/4299\/files\/product_bundle_square.png?v=1778621608","url":"https:\/\/eraformaudio.com\/products\/fraction-studio-collection","provider":"Eraform Audio","version":"1.0","type":"link"}